		(property "Description" "CPU: Dual Arm Cortex-M33 or dual Hazard3 RISC-V processors @ 150MHz Memory:  520 KB on-chip SRAM, in ten independent banks  Support for up to 16 MB of external QSPI flash/PSRAM via dedicated QSPI bus; additional 16 MB flash/PSRAM accessible via optional second chip-select Peripherals:  2UART  2SPI controllers  2I2C controllers  24PWM channels  4/8  ADC channels  1USB 1.1 controller and PHY, with host and device support  12PIO state machines Security features:  Optio\n\nSource: https://datasheets.raspberrypi.com/rp2350/rp2350-product-brief.pdf  Datasheet"
